    {
      "text": "I apologize for the difficulty in locating the exact text of Chapter 8. The tools are either returning general information or repeating the beginning of the book. A robust analysis of free indirect discourse requires specific textual evidence, which I cannot reliably extract right now.\n\nTo provide you with an answer based on the *established literary criticism* of this famous technique in the novel, I will use `web_search__web_search` to find critical analysis of the Vaubyessard ball scene. This will help illustrate where and how the technique is used, which should align with the passages you are trying to find in your library's copy.",
      "mediaUrl": null
